sequenceDiagram
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant CA as ConfidenceAgent
    participant LLM as GPT-4o
    participant DB as Database

    Orch->>CA: run(session)
    CA->>CA: Build prompt to score each field\nFields: name, description, base_url,\nversion, auth_type,\neach endpoint name path method params
    CA->>LLM: chat_json(system, user, max_tokens=2048)
    LLM-->>CA: confidence_map JSON

    Note over CA: Example output structure
    Note over CA: name → status HIGH\nbase_url → status LOW suggestion verify URL\nendpoints.0.path → status HIGH\nendpoints.0.params.0 → status MEDIUM

    CA->>DB: UPDATE session\nconfidence_map = scored fields
    CA->>DB: UPDATE state = HITL_PENDING
    CA-->>Orch: done → HITL_PENDING pause for human

    Note over DB: HIGH = GREEN dot on frontend\nMEDIUM = AMBER dot on frontend\nLOW = RED dot on frontend\nMISSING = GREY dot on frontend
